# InspectAI specific.
## Raw eval logs can contain prompts, model outputs, grader comments, and metadata.
## The committed logs in `logs/` are generated from synthetic / published-source
## scenarios and are published intentionally via GitHub Pages (see docs/ and
## `just bundle-logs`). Review before committing any logs produced from private
## prompts, real-world data, or non-public material.
##
## `logs-www/` is the legacy local bundle output; the published bundle now lives in
## `docs/logs/` and IS committed.
logs-www/
